> SET attributes= attributes || hstore(‘usco@TP-TotPop@2010’::TEXT, 9.315
> ::TEXT ) 
>
> Which is casting both arguments to TEXT.  The red text is added.
>
> In any case this is not the RPostgreSQL driver.
>
> Neil
